Package: sapnDist
Type: Package
Title: The Smooth Additive-Perturbed Normal Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Subha", "Halder", email = "sb.halder12345@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Density, distribution, quantile, and random generation functions
    for the Smooth Additive-Perturbed Normal (SAPN) distribution, obtained by
    perturbing the normal density with a scale-invariant sigmoid term. Provides
    method-of-moments and maximum-likelihood estimators, delta-method and Wald
    confidence intervals, theoretical skewness and excess kurtosis, and a
    parametric bootstrap Anderson-Darling goodness-of-fit test.
